\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Algorithms & Pipeline Details\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 1) Ingest & Crawl
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Accept URL/file \uc0\u8594  enqueue job; for a URL, crawl same\u8209 site policy links with depth=1\'962 (robots-aware) and MIME allowlist.\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Hash and dedupe by canonical text to avoid noisy churn from cosmetic edits.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 2) Extraction & Normalization
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls11\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Prefer text\uc0\u8209 native paths: HTML\u8594 text; DOCX/RTF\u8594 text; for scanned PDFs/images, OCR.\
\ls11\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Preserve page numbers and header hierarchy; segment into overlapping chunks with anchors (
\f2\fs26 section_id
\f1\fs24 , 
\f2\fs26 page
\f1\fs24 ).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 3) Clause Detection (Hybrid)
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls12\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Rules pass
\f1\b0  (deterministic): curated regex/phrase lists per category and jurisdiction cues (e.g., "binding arbitration", "class action waiver", "we may change these terms at any time", "data retention", "data residency", "sub\uc0\u8209 processor", "third party", "sale/share"). Use negation and proximity logic to reduce false positives.\
\ls12\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 ML pass
\f1\b0  (probabilistic): per\uc0\u8209 chunk multi\u8209 label classification for ~20\'9630 clause types + severity hints; add a jurisdiction tagger. Ensemble with rules via calibrated logistic stacking to output 
\f2\fs26 score \uc0\u8712  [0,1]
\f1\fs24  and integer 
\f2\fs26 severity 0\'964
\f1\fs24 .\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 4) Evidence Binding & Explainability
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls13\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 For each finding, store: excerpt, start/end offsets, page, and a 2\'963 sentence context window. UI "Verify" view highlights the exact lines in the original snapshot.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 5) Versioning & Diffs
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls14\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Keep every snapshot immutable in S3 with content hash. Compute token\uc0\u8209 level diffs between latest and previous versions; label additions/deletions that intersect high\u8209 risk categories.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 6) Similarity & Compare (2\'963 vendors)
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls15\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Embed chunks and index for semantic search; compare vendors by aggregating presence/absence and severity per category and showing deltas.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 7) Rubric Scoring (from attached rubric v0.1)
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls16\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Categories & weights: Product Integrity 0.20; Legal Signal Quality 0.25; Privacy & Security 0.15; Accessibility & Usability 0.15; Visual & Interaction 0.10; Performance & Reliability 0.10; Governance Readiness 0.05.\
\ls16\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Compute 
\f2\fs26 weighted = weight \'d7 score_raw(1\'965)
\f1\fs24  per category; sum to 
\f2\fs26 total
\f1\fs24 . Target pass: average \uc0\u8805  4.2; hard block if any (Legal Signal, Privacy, Accessibility) \u8804  2.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 8) Alerts
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls17\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Trigger when: (a) any high\uc0\u8209 severity finding added/changed, (b) total risk \u8593  by threshold, or (c) document updated. Send events to chat/email channels.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Orchestration & Services (AWS\uc0\u8209 native, MVP)\
