\f0\b \cf0 Sequence (URL Ingest \uc0\u8594  Findings \u8594  Alert)\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs26 \cf0 @startuml\
actor User\
participant Web as "Web App"\
participant API as "Ingest API"\
queue Q as "Job Queue"\
participant Crawler\
participant Extract as "Extraction/OCR"\
participant Pipe as "Normalizer+Chunker"\
participant Detect as "Rules+ML"\
database DB as "Aurora"\
collections IDX as "Semantic Index"\
participant Diff\
queue Bus as "Event Bus"\
participant Alert as "Alerting"\
\
User -> Web: Submit URL\
Web -> API: POST /ingest\
API -> Q: enqueue(job)\
Q -> Crawler: fetch & snapshot\
Crawler -> Extract: parse HTML/PDF/DOCX/RTF\
Extract -> Pipe: normalize + chunk\
Pipe -> Detect: rules + ML classify\
Detect -> DB: upsert findings + citations\
Detect -> IDX: upsert embeddings\
DB -> Diff: compare to prior version\
Diff -> DB: store changes\
Diff -> Bus: emit change event\
Bus -> Alert: route to channels\
Alert -> User: Slack/Email notification\
@enduml\
